        <item>
            <title>3.19.0</title>
            <pubDate>Thu, 22 Oct 2026 18:57:24 +0700</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>212</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>3.19.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>What's New in 3.19.0</h2><ul></ul><p><strong>New</strong></p><ul><li>Add sequence numbers to filenames, with your own starting number and leading zeros. Numbering continues separately in each folder.</li></ul><p><strong>Improved</strong></p><ul><li>More compact naming block options, with text before and after the value on one row.</li><li>More reliable folder sorting when a local AI model returns incomplete details.</li></ul><p><strong>Fixed</strong></p><ul><li>Fixed slow or unresponsive file previews and renaming on network drives.</li><li>You can now manage a subscription when a renewal payment needs attention.</li><li>Fixed an issue that could duplicate built-in templates on launch.</li></ul>
]]></description>
